{
  "id": 7884,
  "title": "DDP 与 FSDP 中的内存占用",
  "meta_title": "内存分析：DDP 对比 FSDP",
  "meta_description": "比较分布式数据并行与完全分片数据并行架构的内存使用模式。",
  "content": "<p>训练大型语言模型带来了内存方面的困难，仅靠硬件的线性扩展无法单独解决。使用标准的分布式数据并行 (DDP) 时，训练过程会达到一个由单个 GPU 显存 (VRAM)决定的严格上限。明确此内存占用的具体构成是必需的，以便构建能训练数十亿或数万亿参数 (parameter)模型的系统。</p>\n<h3>模型内存的构成</h3>\n<p>为优化内存使用，我们必须先量化 (quantization)训练单个参数 (parameter)的开销。一个常见误解是，拥有 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span></span></span></span> 个参数的模型需要 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4Ψ</span></span></span></span> 字节（假定为 32 位浮点数）或 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2Ψ</span></span></span></span> 字节（假定为 16 位浮点数）的内存。实际上，使用 Adam 优化器和混合精度进行训练时的内存占用要大得多。</p>\n<p>在标准混合精度训练流程中（计算使用 FP16 或 BF16，权重 (weight)更新使用 FP32），系统必须维护模型状态的多个副本。对于模型中的每个参数，内存分配包含：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>模型参数 (FP16/BF16):</strong> 用于前向和反向传播 (backpropagation)的权重。需要 2 字节。</li>\n<li><strong>梯度 (FP16/BF16):</strong> 反向传播计算得到的梯度。需要 2 字节。</li>\n<li><strong>优化器状态 (FP32):</strong> Adam 优化器需要高精度来保持稳定。它存储：\n<ul>\n<li><strong>主权重:</strong> 参数的高精度副本。需要 4 字节。</li>\n<li><strong>动量 (<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>):</strong> 一阶矩估计。需要 4 字节。</li>\n<li><strong>方差 (<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>):</strong> 二阶矩估计。需要 4 字节。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>将这些部分加起来得到混合精度训练的内存常数：</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mtext> 字节</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{param} = 2 + 2 + 4 + 4 + 4 = 16 \\text{ 字节}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">am</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>因此，拥有 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span></span></span></span> 个参数的模型需要 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16Ψ</span></span></span></span> 字节的静态内存。一个 70 亿参数的模型，在现代大型语言模型（LLM）环境下常被认为是“小型”的，仅加载权重和优化器状态就需要 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7 \\times 10^9 \\times 16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span> 字节，或大约 112 GB 的显存 (VRAM)。这在处理任何一个 token 之前就已超出 NVIDIA A100 (80GB) 的容量。</p>\n<h3>分布式数据并行中的冗余</h3>\n<p>DDP 的运作方式是将整个模型状态复制到集群中的每个 worker 上。如果部署一个包含 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span> 个 GPU 的集群，DDP 会创建 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span> 份相同的模型参数 (parameter)、梯度和优化器状态副本。DDP 中的通信步骤（AllReduce）会同步 worker 间的梯度，但它不会减少任何单个设备上的内存占用。</p>\n<p>随着模型规模的增长，DDP 的效率会降低。虽然 DDP 允许通过增加 GPU 来扩展批处理大小，但它不允许扩展模型规模。每个 GPU 的内存需求保持不变，无论集群大小如何：</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>内存</mtext><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mo>+</mo><mtext>激活内存</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>碎片</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{内存}_{DDP} = 16\\Psi + \\text{激活内存} + \\text{碎片}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">内存</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16Ψ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">激活内存</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">碎片</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>这种架构导致大量的内存冗余。在一个有 16 个 GPU 训练 10 亿参数模型（占用 16 GB 内存）的集群中，总集群内存使用量为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>16</mn><mtext> GB</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>256</mn><mtext> GB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16 \\times 16 \\text{ GB} = 256 \\text{ GB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> GB</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> GB</span></span></span></span></span>。然而，存储的独特信息只有 16 GB。剩下的 240 GB 是重复数据。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>混合精度训练中每个参数的内存分配明细。</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"graphviz-container graphviz-enlargeable\" \n              data-graph-id=\"graph-25gmd\" \n              data-graph-definition='digraph MemoryBreakdown {\r\n    rankdir=LR;\r\n    node [shape=rect, style=filled, fontname=\"Arial\", fontsize=10, height=0.6];\r\n    \r\n    subgraph cluster_0 {\r\n        label=\"混合精度训练 (每个参数 16 字节)\";\r\n        style=dashed;\r\n        color=\"#adb5bd\";\r\n        fontcolor=\"#495057\";\r\n        \r\n        node [color=\"#a5d8ff\", fillcolor=\"#e7f5ff\"];\r\n        W16 [label=\"权重\\n(BF16)\\n2 字节\", width=1.2];\r\n        G16 [label=\"梯度\\n(BF16)\\n2 字节\", width=1.2];\r\n        \r\n        node [color=\"#ffc9c9\", fillcolor=\"#ffe3e3\"];\r\n        W32 [label=\"主权重\\n(FP32)\\n4 字节\", width=1.2];\r\n        M32 [label=\"动量\\n(FP32)\\n4 字节\", width=1.2];\r\n        V32 [label=\"方差\\n(FP32)\\n4 字节\", width=1.2];\r\n    }\r\n    \r\n    W16 -> G16 [style=invis];\r\n    G16 -> W32 [style=invis];\r\n    W32 -> M32 [style=invis];\r\n    M32 -> V32 [style=invis];\r\n}' \n              data-original-width=\"1200px\"\n              style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 200px;\"\n              title=\"Click to enlarge\"\n              aria-label=\"Graphviz diagram - click to enlarge\"\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              role=\"button\"\n              onclick=\"window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n              onkeydown=\"if(event.key==='Enter') window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"graph-25gmd\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 200px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<h3>ZeRO：消除冗余</h3>\n<p>零冗余优化器 (ZeRO) 解决了这种低效问题，其原理是：虽然所有 GPU 在正向和反向传播 (backpropagation)期间都需要访问所有权重 (weight)，但它们无需同时持久化所有权重、梯度和优化器状态。</p>\n<p>ZeRO 将模型状态在可用的数据并行进程之间进行分区（分片）。如果有 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个 GPU，ZeRO 会分割数据，使得每个 GPU 拥有总状态的 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/N_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这种分片可分三个渐进阶段实施，每个阶段都能带来更大的内存节省，代价是通信复杂程度增加。</p>\n<h4>阶段 1：优化器状态分片</h4>\n<p>优化器状态（主权重、动量、方差）构成内存占用的主体（16 字节中的 12 字节）。在阶段 1 中，这些状态在 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个 GPU 之间分片。每个 GPU 只更新其分配到的优化器状态分区。</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>内存</mtext><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mtext> (权重)</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mtext> (梯度)</mtext><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mfrac><mtext> (优化器状态)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{内存}_{Stage1} = 2\\Psi \\text{ (权重)} + 2\\Psi \\text{ (梯度)} + \\frac{12\\Psi}{N_d} \\text{ (优化器状态)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">内存</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2Ψ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> (</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">权重</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2Ψ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> (</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">梯度</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3232em;vertical-align:-0.4509em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12Ψ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4509em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> (</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">优化器状态</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h4>阶段 2：梯度分片</h4>\n<p>阶段 2 将分片扩展到梯度。梯度在反向传播期间计算出来后，它们会立即被归约和分片，而不是在本地聚合。</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>内存</mtext><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mtext> (权重)</mtext><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{内存}_{Stage2} = 2\\Psi \\text{ (权重)} + \\frac{2\\Psi + 12\\Psi}{N_d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">内存</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2Ψ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> (</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">权重</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3232em;vertical-align:-0.4509em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2Ψ</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">12Ψ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4509em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h4>阶段 3：参数 (parameter)分片</h4>\n<p>阶段 3 是 FSDP 的核心。它分片模型参数本身。在此阶段，GPU 只保留模型的一小部分。当计算需要某个特定层时，参数会从其他 GPU 收集过来，使用后立即丢弃以释放内存。</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>内存</mtext><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{内存}_{Stage3} = \\frac{16\\Psi}{N_d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">内存</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3232em;vertical-align:-0.4509em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">16Ψ</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4509em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>ZeRO 阶段 3 的理论极限使每个设备的内存占用趋近于零，随着设备数量 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的增加，从而将大部分显存 (VRAM)留给激活和更大的批处理大小。</p>\n<h3>对比分析：DDP 与 FSDP 的扩展</h3>\n<p>内存效率的差异变得明显，随着我们扩展 GPU 数量。使用 DDP 时，增加 GPU 不会降低每个设备的内存压力。使用 FSDP (ZeRO 阶段 3) 时，内存压力会随着硬件的增加而线性减少。</p>\n<p>例如，一个训练拥有 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span></span></span></span> 参数 (parameter)的大型语言模型的情景。下面的图表显示了随着集群规模的扩大，80GB A100 GPU 上可训练的最大模型规模。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>随着集群规模扩展，每个 GPU 可训练的最大模型规模（以十亿参数计）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"plotly-container\" \n              data-plot-id=\"plot-5002i3\" \n              data-plot-definition='{\"layout\": {\"title\": \"最大可训练模型规模：DDP 对比 FSDP (ZeRO-3)\", \"xaxis\": {\"title\": \"GPU 数量\", \"tickvals\": [1, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64]}, \"yaxis\": {\"title\": \"最大参数量 (十亿)\"}, \"template\": \"simple_white\", \"showlegend\": true, \"width\": 700, \"height\": 450}, \"data\": [{\"x\": [1, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64], \"y\": [3.5, 3.5, 3.5, 3.5, 3.5, 3.5], \"type\": \"scatter\", \"mode\": \"lines+markers\", \"name\": \"DDP (固定上限)\", \"line\": {\"color\": \"#fa5252\", \"width\": 3}}, {\"x\": [1, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64], \"y\": [3.5, 13, 25, 48, 92, 175], \"type\": \"scatter\", \"mode\": \"lines+markers\", \"name\": \"FSDP (线性扩展)\", \"line\": {\"color\": \"#228be6\", \"width\": 3}}]}' \n              style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; min-height: 450px;\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"plot-5002i3\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 450px;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<p>在 DDP 配置中（红线），每个 GPU 的最大模型规模被严格限定在大约 35 亿参数（为激活留出缓冲）。增加 60 个 GPU 也不会改变这个限制。在 FSDP 配置中（蓝线），容量线性扩展。拥有 64 个 GPU 时，集群能够有效训练接近 1750 亿参数的模型，因为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16Ψ</span></span></span></span> 的静态状态被稀疏地分布在集群中。</p>\n<h3>对激活内存的影响</h3>\n<p>需要注意，ZeRO 只减少 <em>模型状态</em> 的内存占用。它本身不会减少 <em>激活</em> 所需的内存，即那些为反向传播 (backpropagation)存储的层中间输出。激活内存取决于批处理大小、序列长度和 Transformer 架构（例如，隐藏维度、注意力头）。</p>\n<p>尽管 FSDP 从模型参数 (parameter)中释放了大量显存 (VRAM)，但训练 TB 级模型通常需要将 FSDP 与 <strong>激活检查点</strong> 结合（在反向传播期间重新计算激活），以将激活内存保持在限制内。我们将在第 3 章实施这种集成。</p>\n<p>通过从 DDP 转向 FSDP，我们从模型架构受限于单设备限制的模式，转移到模型规模仅受总集群容量和网络带宽限制的模式。</p>",
